{"surah":101,"ayahs":[{"numberInSurah":1,"arabicText":"اَلْقَارِعَةُۙ","translation":"The Striking Calamity -"},{"numberInSurah":2,"arabicText":"مَا الْقَارِعَةُۚ","translation":"What is the Striking Calamity?"},{"numberInSurah":3,"arabicText":"وَ مَاۤ اَدْرٰىكَ مَا الْقَارِعَةُؕ","translation":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity?"},{"numberInSurah":4,"arabicText":"یَوْمَ یَكُوْنُ النَّاسُ كَالْفَرَاشِ الْمَبْثُوْثِۙ","translation":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed,"},{"numberInSurah":5,"arabicText":"وَ تَكُوْنُ الْجِبَالُ كَالْعِهْنِ الْمَنْفُوْشِؕ","translation":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up."},{"numberInSurah":6,"arabicText":"فَاَمَّا مَنْ ثَقُلَتْ مَوَازِیْنُهٗۙ","translation":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds],"},{"numberInSurah":7,"arabicText":"فَهُوَ فِیْ عِیْشَةٍ رَّاضِیَةٍؕ","translation":"He will be in a pleasant life."},{"numberInSurah":8,"arabicText":"وَ اَمَّا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَوَازِیْنُهٗۙ","translation":"But as for one whose scales are light,"},{"numberInSurah":9,"arabicText":"فَاُمُّهٗ هَاوِیَةٌؕ","translation":"His refuge will be an abyss."},{"numberInSurah":10,"arabicText":"وَ مَاۤ اَدْرٰىكَ مَاهِیَهْؕ","translation":"And what can make you know what that is?"},{"numberInSurah":11,"arabicText":"نَارٌ حَامِیَةٌ۠ ۧ","translation":"It is a Fire, intensely hot."}]}